ated>2026-09-06T12:13:29Z</updated><published>2026-09-06T05:52:06Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/europe/20260906-germany-s-far-right-afd-eyes-historic-state-victory-in-saxony-anhalt-election--d84eb1b6b427.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20260906-germany-s-far-right-afd-eyes-historic-state-victory-in-saxony-anhalt-election" /><summary type="html">Germany's anti-immigrant Alternative for Germany party is aiming to become the first far-right party to take power at a state level since World War II as voters in the eastern German state of Saxony-Anhalt head to the polls Sunday. However, a failure to secure an absolute majority may see the politically isolated party struggle to form a government.</summary><category term="Europe" /></entry><entry><title>Live: Trump's envoys arrive in Kyiv after 'substantive' talks with Putin</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:9c07ed62be1ce2e110cda891d1d5874cbf9a6b28f09d82a6d5fe9612429d55d6</id><updated>2026-09-06T12:13:08Z</updated><published>2026-09-06T04:57:43Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/europe/20260906-live-trump-s-envoys-head-to-ukraine-after-substantive-talks-with-putin--f41091ccbfca.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20260906-live-trump-s-envoys-head-to-ukraine-after-substantive-talks-with-putin" /><summary type="html">American envoys Steve Witkoff and Jared Kushner discussed "substantive plans" for next steps to end the war in Ukraine during their meeting with Russian President Vladimir Putin in Moscow, the White House said, before they headed to Kyiv on Sunday. Kremlin aide Yuri Ushakov said the three-hour talks had been "highly useful" but gave no indication that a breakthrough had been reached. Follow our liveblog for all the latest updates.</summary><category term="Europe" /></entry><entry><title>Witkoff: Putin’s Messenger?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry